{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
<style>
/* Core layout and playful-yet-premium styling */
body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;color:#113;background:#f7fbf9}
.header{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0));backdrop-filter:saturate(120%) blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,26,24,0.03);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50}
.container{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
.nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
.brand{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.navlinks{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
a.navlink{color:#0c2b23;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
a.cta{background:#0a6b4a;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none}
.hero{background-image:url("assets/img/pattern.svg");background-repeat:repeat;padding:56px 0 40px}
.hero-inner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center}
h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:#082018}
.lead{color:#235941;margin:0 0 18px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(11,18,16,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(7,14,12,0.03)}
.contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:14px}
form.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
label{font-size:13px;color:#0b3729}
input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6efe9;background:#fbfffc}
textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
button{background:#0a6b4a;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.small{font-size:13px;color:#3a6b5a}
.section{max-width:980px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:24px;align-items:start}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 480ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1),transform 480ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)}
.revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
.footer{padding:30px 0;text-align:center;color:#567a6b;font-size:14px}
.session-widget h3{margin-top:0}
.controls{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.inline{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.pill{background:#f0fbf7;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #e1f3ea;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
.copy-btn{background:#eef7f3;border:1px solid #d9efe6;color:#0a6b4a;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
.summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbfffc;border:1px dashed #d8efe5;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;min-height:100px}
.kicker{font-size:12px;color:#2c6b58;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;font-weight:700}
/* responsive */
@media (max-width:880px){.hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.navlinks{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="header">
<div class="container nav">
<div class="brand"><span class="kicker">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</span></div>
<nav class="navlinks">
<a class="navlink" href="index.html">Home</a>
<a class="navlink" href="services.html">Practices</a>
<a class="navlink" href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
<a class="navlink" href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
<a class="navlink" href="about.html">Cohorts</a>
<a class="navlink" href="pricing.html">Pricing</a>
<a class="navlink" href="book.html">Book</a>
<a class="navlink cta" href="contact.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-inner container reveal">
<div>
<h1>Let's shape your next session</h1>
<p class="lead">A friendly line to ask how you'd like to be supported. Tell us a little, and we'll help you plan a practical session path — small, steady-oriented steps for body and mind.</p>
<div class="card contact-card">
<p class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
<p class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
<p class="small">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
<p class="small">Prefer calling? Ring us or send a quick note — we'll reply within a few business days.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card reveal contact-form" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
<h2 id="contact-heading">Drop a note</h2>
<form id="contactForm" class="field" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); handleContactSubmit();">
<label for="name">Your name</label>
<input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name">
<label for="email">Email</label>
<input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">
<label for="message">What would you like support with?</label>
<textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A few lines about your aims or questions"></textarea>
<button type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
<p class="small" id="contactStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section grid">
<div class="card reveal session-widget" aria-labelledby="planner-h">
<h3 id="planner-h">Session Planner</h3>
<p class="small">Build a short plan that fits your rhythm. Export it as plaintext to bring into notes, email, or to share with your cohort.</p>
<div class="controls">
<label for="concern">Primary concern</label>
<select id="concern">
<option value="Stress &amp; sleep">Stress &amp; sleep</option>
<option value="Digestive balance">Digestive balance</option>
<option value="Energy &amp; focus">Energy &amp; focus</option>
<option value="Chronic pain">Chronic pain</option>
<option value="Women's health">Women's health</option>
</select>

<label>Preferred session length</label>
<div class="inline">
<label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="length" value="30" checked> 30m</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="length" value="60"> 60m</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="length" value="90"> 90m</label>
</div>

<label>Modality focus</label>
<div class="inline">
<label class="pill"><input type="checkbox" value="Nutrition"> Nutrition</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="checkbox" value="Movement"> Movement</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="checkbox" value="Herbal"> Herbal</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="checkbox" value="Breathwork"> Breathwork</label>
<label class="pill"><input type="checkbox" value="Mind-Body"> Mind-Body</label>
</div>

<label>How often would you like touchpoints?</label>
<select id="freq">
<option value="Weekly">Weekly</option>
<option value="Biweekly">Biweekly</option>
<option value="Monthly">Monthly</option>
</select>

<label for="goals">Personal goals or notes (brief)</label>
<input id="goals" type="text" placeholder="E.g., sleep 7-8h, reduce bloating, manage flare-ups">

<div class="inline">
<button id="buildBtn" type="button">Create Plan</button>
<button id="copyBtn" class="copy-btn" type="button" disabled>Copy Summary</button>
</div>
</div>

<h4 style="margin-top:18px">Plan summary</h4>
<div id="summary" class="summary" aria-live="polite"></div>
</div>

<aside class="card reveal">
<h4>Quick contact</h4>
<ul class="contact-list">
<li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
<li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
<li>Address: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
<li><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
</ul>
</aside>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
<div class="card">
<h3>Visiting in person?</h3>
<p class="small">We welcome in-person and remote sessions. If you have mobility or access needs, tell us in your message and we'll accommodate where possible.</p>
</div>
</section>

<footer class="footer reveal">
<p>Questions about cohorts, curriculum, or how we work? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>
<p class="small">This site provides educational information and planning tools, not medical advice. For urgent medical concerns consult a licensed provider.</p>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
/* prefers-reduced-motion aware reveal */
var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
var reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
function revealNow(node){ node.classList.add('revealed'); node.classList.remove('reveal'); }
if(prefersReduced){
  reveals.forEach(revealNow);
}else{
  var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){ entries.forEach(function(e){
    if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('revealed'); obs.unobserve(e.target); }
  })},{threshold:0.12});
  reveals.forEach(function(r){ obs.observe(r); });
}

/* contact form feedback (no network) */
window.handleContactSubmit = function(){
  var status = document.getElementById('contactStatus');
  status.textContent = 'Thanks — your note is queued for a reply. We usually respond in 1-3 business days.';
  document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
}

/* session planner logic */
function gatherSelectedCheckboxes(container){
  var checked = [];
  container.querySelectorAll('input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(function(cb){
    if(cb.checked) checked.push(cb.value);
  });
  return checked;
}

var buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildBtn');
var copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
var summaryEl = document.getElementById('summary');

function buildPlan(){
  var concern = document.getElementById('concern').value;
  var length = document.querySelector('input[name="length"]:checked').value;
  var freq = document.getElementById('freq').value;
  var goals = document.getElementById('goals').value.trim() || 'No specific notes';
  var modalityNodes = document.querySelectorAll('.session-widget input[type="checkbox"]');
  var modalities = [];
  modalityNodes.forEach(function(n){ if(n.checked) modalities.push(n.value); });
  if(modalities.length===0) modalities.push('General integrative approach');

  var date = new Date();
  var created = date.toLocaleDateString() + ' ' + date.toLocaleTimeString();

  var lines = [];
  lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Personalized Session Plan');
  lines.push('Created: ' + created);
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Primary concern: ' + concern);
  lines.push('Session length: ' + length + ' minutes');
  lines.push('Touchpoints: ' + freq);
  lines.push('Focused modalities: ' + modalities.join(', '));
  lines.push('Personal goals/notes: ' + goals);
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Suggested first-session outline:');
  lines.push('- Intake & top priorities (10–15m)');
  if(length==='30') lines.push('- Focused intervention (10–15m)');
  else if(length==='60') lines.push('- Assessment + tailored practices (30–40m)');
  else lines.push('- Comprehensive assessment & layering of practices (45–60m)');
  lines.push('- Practical takeaways and 2–3 micro-habits to try between sessions');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Micro-habit suggestions:');
  if(modalities.indexOf('Breathwork')>-1) lines.push('- Short breath practice: 3–5 minutes before bed');
  if(modalities.indexOf('Mind-Body')>-1) lines.push('- Evening body-scan for sleep support (5–10m)');
  if(modalities.indexOf('Nutrition')>-1) lines.push('- Simple food pairing for digestion: mindful chewing + hydration');
  if(modalities.indexOf('Movement')>-1) lines.push('- Gentle 10-minute mobility routine in the morning');
  if(modalities.indexOf('Herbal')>-1) lines.push('- Consider a short-term herbal tea support plan (discuss in session)');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Follow-up rhythm: ' + freq + ' sessions, adjust based on response.');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Notes: This plan is educational and intended to guide discussion. For medical concerns seek a licensed clinician.');
  var text = lines.join('\\n');
  summaryEl.textContent = text;
  copyBtn.disabled = false;
  copyBtn.dataset.clip = text;
}

buildBtn.addEventListener('click', buildPlan);

copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
  var text = copyBtn.dataset.clip || '';
  if(!text) return;
  navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText ? navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
    copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
    setTimeout(function(){ copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Summary'; },1600);
  }).catch(function(){
    var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
    ta.value = text;
    document.body.appendChild(ta);
    ta.select();
    try{ document.execCommand('copy'); copyBtn.textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(function(){copyBtn.textContent='Copy Summary';},1600);}catch(e){ alert('Copy not supported'); }
    document.body.removeChild(ta);
  }) : alert('Copy not supported in this browser.');
});

/* accessibility small: ensure focusable summary */
summaryEl.setAttribute('tabindex','0');

})(); 
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4: contact.html + README for holistic_medicine site

Files included:
- contact.html: Contact page with an interactive "Session Planner" widget and a prefers-reduced-motion aware scroll reveal.

How to test locally:
1. Place this file in your site folder alongside the other pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).
2. Ensure you have the site asset: assets/img/pattern.svg (this project uses a custom SVG pattern referenced in CSS).
3. Open contact.html in a browser.

Features implemented:
- Session Planner widget
  - Pick a primary concern, session length, modalities, frequency, and short goals.
  - "Create Plan" builds a plaintext summary optimized for copying or pasting.
  - "Copy Summary" uses the Clipboard API with a fallback for older browsers.
  - Output includes suggested micro-habits and a brief first-session outline.
  - Disclaimer included: educational content, not medical advice.

- Scroll-triggered reveal animations
  - Uses IntersectionObserver to reveal elements with the .reveal class.
  - Respects prefers-reduced-motion: when the user prefers reduced motion, elements are revealed immediately without animation.

Accessibility and design notes:
- Summary area has aria-live="polite" and is focusable (tabindex=0) so screen reader users can access generated text.
- Contact form is a lightweight local handler (no external network calls) that provides immediate feedback; replace with your preferred backend endpoint for production.

Placeholders to replace in templates:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Developer notes:
- No external fonts or CDNs are referenced; adjust font-family stacks as needed.
- The Session Planner intentionally produces plaintext (\n-separated) so it can be copied into notes or email clients.
- The page intentionally avoids medical promises and maintains an educational tone.

If you need a different layout or an additional export option (e.g., download .txt), tell me and I will add it."}
BUNDLE_END
